### Testar BET
POST http://localhost:3000/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:bet-http-001

{
  "providerId": "provider-a",
  "externalTransactionId": "bet-http-001",
  "playerId": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
  "walletId": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
  "roundId": "round-http-001",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": {
    "amount": "25.00",
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}

### WIN - Creditar ganho
POST http://localhost:3000/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:win-http-001

{
  "providerId": "provider-a",
  "externalTransactionId": "win-http-001",
  "playerId": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
  "walletId": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
  "roundId": "round-http-001",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "WIN",
  "money": {
    "amount": "40.00",
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}

### REFUND - Devolver a BET original
POST http://localhost:3000/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:refund-http-001

{
  "providerId": "provider-a",
  "externalTransactionId": "refund-http-001",
  "playerId": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
  "walletId": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
  "roundId": "round-http-001",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "REFUND",
  "referenceExternalTransactionId": "bet-http-001",
  "money": {
    "amount": "25.00",
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}


### ROLLBACK - Reverter WIN original
POST http://localhost:3000/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:rollback-http-001

{
  "providerId": "provider-a",
  "externalTransactionId": "rollback-http-001",
  "playerId": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
  "walletId": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
  "roundId": "round-http-001",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "ROLLBACK",
  "referenceExternalTransactionId": "win-http-001",
  "money": {
    "amount": "40.00",
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}

### Criar carteira com saldo inicial
POST http://localhost:3000/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": "33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333",
  "initialBalance": {
    "amount": "1000.00",
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}

### CONSULTAS

### Consultar carteira
GET http://localhost:3000/wallets/d4086200-5ed1-46b2-a45d-2f8ecd3976d2

### Consultar carteira inexistente
GET http://localhost:3000/wallets/99999999-9999-4999-8999-999999999999

### Histórico financeiro da carteira
GET http://localhost:3000/wallets/d4086200-5ed1-46b2-a45d-2f8ecd3976d2/ledger?limit=20

### Histórico com apenas um lançamento por página
GET http://localhost:3000/wallets/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111/ledger?limit=1

### Limite inválido
GET http://localhost:3000/wallets/d4086200-5ed1-46b2-a45d-2f8ecd3976d2/ledger?limit=200

### Cursor inválido
GET http://localhost:3000/wallets/d4086200-5ed1-46b2-a45d-2f8ecd3976d2/ledger?cursor=invalido
### Segundo lançamento da página seguinte
GET http://localhost:3000/wallets/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111/ledger?limit=1&cursor=eyJjcmVhdGVkQXQiOiIyMDI2LTExLTIxVDAwOjE4OjIyLjc2OVoiLCJpZCI6IjMyMDI3M2QxLWNkMDAtNGQ0Yy1hZjIyLWQ5MTFkMTlkMTFlNiJ9

### 1. Consultar transação pelo UUID interno
GET http://localhost:3000/wagering/transactions/216943a7-47c0-4b4d-a73c-8af4d05c9eb8

### 2. Consultar transação pelo ID externo do provedor
GET http://localhost:3000/providers/provider-a/wagering/transactions/bet-http-001

### 3. Consultar transação interna inexistente
GET http://localhost:3000/wagering/transactions/99999999-9999-4999-8999-999999999999

### 4. Consultar transação externa inexistente
GET http://localhost:3000/providers/provider-a/wagering/transactions/inexistente

